{"a":[43,43],"h":"<p>43.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"241\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 240.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 31.6 38.3 38.3 45.0 51.7 51.7 68.3 75.0 83.3 83.3 90.0 90.0 97.6 97.6 111.7 127.6 127.6 138.0 144.7 151.6 151.6 158.3 162.7 170.3 186.0 202.6 202.6 209.3 209.3 216.0\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 38.3 75.0 111.7 144.7 158.3 186.0 216.0 224.3\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Bu meseller, biz onları insanlar için darb ediyoruz - kâfirler demişlerdi ki Gökleri ve Yeri yaradan Allah nasıl olur da böyle örümcek, sinek gibi hevam Allah ve haşerat ile mesel darb eder? Bununla Allah, ne demek istiyor: « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"183\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 183.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 8.3 15.0 21.7 37.6 44.3 53.3 53.3 61.6 61.6 68.3 77.3 77.3 84.0 84.0 84.0 90.7 98.3 114.0 121.6 128.3 136.6 152.3 152.3 159.0 166.6 173.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"15.0 21.7 44.3 114.0 128.3 136.6 159.0 173.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » Bu suâle karşı sûrei Bakarede «</p><p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"387\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 387.2 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.7 18.0 24.7 24.7 33.0 48.7 55.4 64.4 80.2 80.2 87.0 100.4 108.7 108.7 115.4 122.2 129.0 144.7 150.0 156.7 163.4 179.2 195.7 195.7 203.2 203.2 217.4 233.2 233.2 243.7 259.4 259.4 259.4 270.7 270.7 283.4 290.2 302.2 309.0 330.0 336.7 336.7 336.7 343.4 351.0 366.7 366.7 377.2 377.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 2